@node Miscellaneous
@subsection Stop@comma{} Silence@comma{} Restart@comma{} Or Identify Speech

Stopping speech ends the current output without disabling future feedback.
Quiet mode is useful when you temporarily want to keep working without speech.
Restart the server after correcting a backend problem or changing the selected
synthesizer.

@table @kbd
@item C-e s
@findex tts-stop

@kindex C-e s

@code{tts-stop}

Stop speech now.
@item C-e d q
@findex tts-toggle-quiet

@kindex C-e d q

@code{tts-toggle-quiet}

Toggle speech in the current buffer.  Press @kbd{C-u} first to toggle it
globally.
@item C-e C-s
