@node Desktop Applications
@section Desktop Applications

@subsection Terminal Applications

For a new full-terminal workflow@comma{} use @ref{EAT Terminal Access}.  When a
built-in terminal with no additional package is preferable@comma{} use
@ref{Running Terminal Based Applications}.  For ordinary line-oriented shell
commands@comma{} @kbd{M-x shell} is usually the simplest route.

@subsection Forms Mode

@cindex Forms mode

@findex forms-find-file

The built-in Forms library presents records from a structured text file one at
